<title>FRANCE: Block of Generale des Eaux shares traded.</title>
<headline>Block of Generale des Eaux shares traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 300,000 shares in Generale des Eaux, representing 0.2 percent of the company's capital, was traded at 0948 GMT on Tuesday at a price of 805 francs per share, market sources said.</p>
<p>The share was trading at 799 francs, up 0.76 percent, at 1210 GMT.</p>
</text>
